            <h2 class="pipe">Site Excavation, Asphalt Paving & Stonework in Mendon, MA</h2>
            <p><strong>S. Phaneuf & Associates</strong> supplies professional site excavation, residential driveway paving, and <a href="/worcester-county/hardscape-contractor-mendon-ma">custom stone masonry</a> for homeowners and commercial businesses in <strong>Mendon, Massachusetts</strong>. Located in southern Worcester County, Mendon features rocky terrain, shallow ledge formations, and expansive farm properties. Deep winter freezing causes severe soil expansion that easily cracks thin asphalt driveways and causes unanchored retaining walls to bulge. S. Phaneuf & Associates counters these local climate forces by installing deep aggregate sub-bases, reinforced fieldstone walls, and dense hot-mix asphalt engineered to withstand Mendon's winter conditions.</p>
        </section>

